WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:05.009
Peak TV is here to stay, with networks and
streaming services already lining up exciting

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:06.779
new series for years to come.

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:10.550
Looking ahead to next year, we're already
excited for a slew of shows with huge stars

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:14.230
on both sides of the camera—and intriguing
and interesting premises ready to bring new

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.759
perspectives to the small screen.

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:19.520
Get ready to make plenty of room in your queue,
because these are just some of the many TV

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.440
shows you can look forward to watching in
2018.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.000
Black Lightning

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.590
The CW is taking on a more mature superhero
with Black Lightning, a former masked vigilante

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.800
who spent years keeping the streets safe.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.320
Starring Cress Williams as Jefferson Pierce,
the show will follow his close calls fighting

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.800
local gang the One Hundred and how his wife
convinced him to quit for the sake of his

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.800
daughters.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.400
After years of safely operating as a high
school principal, though, Jefferson is eventually

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.660
called back into crime fighting as the One
Hundred takes over the town again.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:50.550
He'll eventually enlist the aid of his daughters
Jennifer and Anissa, who'll take on the identities

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.860
Thunder and Lightning.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.470
Black Lightning reportedly won't initially
be set in the Arrow-verse with the rest of

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:59.710
the CW's superhero shows, which offers up
a lot of creative freedom for the series to

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:05.280
establish its own tone and pace once this
show lands on-screen January 16th.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.280
The Alienist

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:10.280
TNT is going period for their next prestige
drama, The Alienist.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:14.650
This psychological thriller stars Daniel Bruhl
as Dr. Laszlo Kreizler, an expert searching

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:18.080
for the person responsible for the demise
of several boys in New York City.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:22.080
The cast also includes Luke Evans as his partner,
and Dakota Fanning as a woman with hidden

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.950
information related to their search.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.290
Kreizler will stop at nothing.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:28.600
"Even if it leads me to the darkest pit of
hell."

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.290
Think of it as Mindhunter with a late 19th
Century twist.

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.530
The Alienist lands on the small screen January
22nd.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.540
A.P. Bio

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:41.430
Following his turn in It's Always Sunny in
Philadelphia, Glenn Howerton's newest series

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.430
puts him in the lead.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:47.820
Titled A.P. Bio, the sitcom comes from Saturday
Night Live alums Seth Meyers and Lorne Michaels.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:51.380
Howerton will play a philosophy scholar who
loses out on his dream job and goes to work

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.200
as a high school biology teacher.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.960
Realizing he has a room full of honor roll
students at his disposal, he decides to eschew

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:00.350
teaching biology and instead use the kids
to his own benefit.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.580
The show is set to debut midseason on NBC.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:07.000
"It is a very f---ed up reflection of how
things are."

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.959
The Ballad of Buster Scruggs

00:02:08.959 --> 00:02:12.870
The Coen brothers are scheduled to jump on
the Netflix bandwagon in 2018 with The Ballad

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:17.450
of Buster Scruggs, which follows six stories
about the American frontier, with each chapter

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.709
of the anthology focusing on a different plot.

00:02:19.709 --> 00:02:23.190
Tim Blake Nelson will portray the titular
singing cowboy in the first episode, with

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:27.280
other A-listers coming in to round out the
rest of the season's stars, including Stephen

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.769
Root, Ralph Ineson, James Franco, and Zoe
Kazan.

00:02:30.769 --> 00:02:34.230
Westerns have a complicated history on the
small screen, but if anyone can do it, it's

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:38.340
the guys who brought us True Grit and No Country
for Old Men.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.529
Castle Rock

00:02:39.529 --> 00:02:43.529
Stephen King stories are always prime fodder
for adaptations, and Hulu is looking to jump

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:47.159
back in the game with the 10-episode psychological
thriller, Castle Rock.

00:02:47.159 --> 00:02:50.840
The anthology show, which will follow different
sets of characters from King's novels, will

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:55.410
revolve around the fictional Maine town featured
in King-based movies like Stand By Me, Cujo,

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.620
and Needful Things.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.250
Andre Holland is set to star as Henry, a death
row attorney with a unique and complicated

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.250
history.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.760
And the cast is full of people who should
be familiar to fans of adaptations of King's

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.310
work, including Carrie's Sissy Spacek and
It's Bill Skarsgård.

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:12.950
The show is rounded out by an ensemble that
includes Melanie Lynskey, Jane Levy, and Scott

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:13.950
Glenn.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:17.279
With King's properties at peak popularity
right now, this small screen homage to his

00:03:17.279 --> 00:03:20.489
literary world is bound to be a hit.

00:03:20.489 --> 00:03:21.639
Cloak and Dagger

00:03:21.639 --> 00:03:25.799
Multiple Marvel series are set to hit your
screens in 2018, but Freeform's Cloak and

00:03:25.799 --> 00:03:27.659
Dagger looks like one of the most exciting.

00:03:27.659 --> 00:03:30.430
The show stars Olivia Holt as Tandy Bowen,
a.k.a.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:34.549
Dagger, a teen raised with the ability to
emit light daggers who is forced to adapt

00:03:34.549 --> 00:03:36.370
after a storm uproots her life.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:39.010
Meanwhile, Aubrey Joseph appears as Tyrone
Johnson, a.k.a.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.440
Cloak, a teen who can engulf people in darkness.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.760
The trailer teases the series' bigger connections
to the MCU, ending with Tyrone standing on

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:51.609
top of the Roxxon Corporation building—an
evil entity featured in other Marvel properties.

00:03:51.609 --> 00:03:54.980
With potentially bigger implications along
with their grounded story, we're excited to

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:58.180
see this superhero pair in action.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.689
Cobra Kai

00:03:59.689 --> 00:04:03.930
The Karate Kid has already gotten a big-screen
modern remake, but Cobra Kai promises to be

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.280
something else entirely.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:09.269
This new show, set to premiere on YouTube
Red, will reunite original franchise stars

00:04:09.269 --> 00:04:13.319
Ralph Macchio and William Zabka to show what
happened to the pair after the events of the

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:15.269
initial 1980s trilogy.

00:04:15.269 --> 00:04:19.660
Taking place more than 30 years after the
fateful events of the 1984 All Valley Karate

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:23.530
Tournament, the new series will see Johnny
looking for redemption by reopening the titular

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.370
dojo—and reigniting his rivalry with Daniel.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:29.810
While Daniel is now successful in life, he's
struggling to find balance without the help

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:33.700
of his mentor Mr. Miyagi, who was played in
the original film by the late Pat Morita.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:38.150
The pair will address their past and present
frustrations through, of course, karate.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:42.150
Get ready to pencil a YouTube Red subscription
into your budget, because this is a series

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.960
you won't want to miss.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.060
Untitled animated Deadpool series

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:50.280
The Merc with a Mouth is taking over the silver
screen again when Deadpool 2 hits theaters

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:54.660
in 2018, but the character will also get some
small screen action courtesy of an animated

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.650
FXX series from Donald Glover.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.430
Glover, who made his MCU debut over the summer
in Spider-Man: Homecoming, is set to write,

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:05.840
executive produce, and serve as co-showrunner
on the series alongside his brother Stephen.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.010
The adult-oriented action-comedy isn't expected
to hew too closely to what we've already seen

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.070
in theaters, though.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:14.320
FX head John Landgraf said the tone of the
series will be "really different" from the

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:18.230
movies, and the goal is to make something
distinct from Ryan Reynolds' take on the character.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.650
"And remember: hugs not drugs."

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.150
Jack Ryan

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:26.670
Although the Jack Ryan movies have been hit
or miss in theaters, this eight-episode Amazon

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:29.340
series might breathe new life into the Tom
Clancy character.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.590
The show will feature John Krasinski in the
title role -- which was previously held in

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:36.190
the films by Alec Baldwin, Harrison Ford,
Ben Affleck, and Chris Pine.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:40.660
And the show will follow the up-and-coming
CIA analyst as he unravels a pattern of terrorist

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.050
communication that could threaten the whole
world.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:46.570
The rest of the cast includes Wendell Pierce
as Jack's boss James Greer, Abbie Cornish

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:51.230
as Cathy Mueller, and others, so count on
this to be an action-adventure for the ages.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:53.100
"Holy s---."

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.170
Krypton

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:58.370
There are already quite a few superhero shows
on TV right now, but Syfy's Krypton looks

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.990
like a different take on the crowded genre.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:03.990
Set on the titular planet 200 years before
the birth of Superman, it shows how the House

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.990
of El was shamed and ostracized.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:10.640
The series will follow Superman's grandfather
Seyg-El on his quest to bring hope and equality

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:14.440
to Krypton, turning a planet in disarray into
one worthy of giving birth to the greatest

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.970
superhero ever known.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:19.990
Fans can expect to see a lot of familiar elements
from the comics, including the villain Brainiac

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:23.320
and Seyg-El's unlikely human mentor Adam Strange.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.710
Origin stories are always iffy, but with Superman's
ancestors at the fore here, this should be

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:30.950
an otherworldly adventure worth watching.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.950
Mosaic

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:36.630
HBO is going experimental for their upcoming
Steven Soderbergh series Mosaic, which follows

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.310
the aftermath of a homicide.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:42.520
Olivia Lake, a famed children's author, goes
missing after romance blossoms with a mysterious

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:43.520
stranger.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:47.250
But this won't be your typical mystery series—through
a mobile app, viewers will be able to create

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.320
their own adventure as they delve into the
twisty plot.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.720
Viewers will get to choose their point of
view and which story to follow, with each

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.390
choice building on the others, enabling the
tale to be told in a multitude of different

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.410
ways and ending in different conclusions.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:02.620
The app will give viewers a few months to
play with it before Soderbergh unveils his

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:07.160
official take on the story in a six-episode
series in January of 2018.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:11.000
If Soderbergh's name and HBO's innovative
method of presenting the content aren't enough

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:15.130
to get you on board, it also has some big
stars attached, including Sharon Stone, Garrett

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.620
Hedlund, Beau Bridges, and Paul Reubens.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:21.560
Experiments are popular in the age of peak
TV, and this seems like one that could succeed

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.740
in a big way.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:24.870
New Warriors

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:28.120
The New Warriors may not currently have a
TV home, but they're expected to hit the small

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.200
screen at some point in 2018.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.980
Marvel's first comedy series was initially
set to debut on Freeform, but it was eventually

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.850
pulled from the network, which wouldn't have
been able to fit it on its schedule.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.320
Although the fact that Freeform dropped the
series is definitely worrisome, New Warriors

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.180
is still setting up to be a lot of fun.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:45.930
The series is set to bring the very popular
Squirrel Girl to live action, with Milana

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.570
Vayntrub taking on the role.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:51.780
Other stars include Derek Theler as Mister
Immortal, Jeremy Tardy as Night Thrasher,

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:56.210
Calum Worthy as Speedball, Matthew Moy as
Microbe, and Kate Comer as Debrii.

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:59.970
The series follows the six aforementioned
young people as they deal with their powers

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:02.990
while trying to make a difference in the world—even
if the world isn't ready.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.820
And since they live and work together, the
series is sure to provide quite a lot of tension

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.710
and comedy.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.220
Untitled Purge series

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:14.400
The Purge franchise has done very well on
the big screen, and now it's coming to TV.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:19.010
Blumhouse Television is set to bring a Purge
"interwoven anthology" show to USA and Syfy

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.090
next year.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:23.889
Franchise and show creator James DeMonaco
has said that he wants the TV series to spend

00:08:23.889 --> 00:08:28.210
more time delving further into the characters'
motivations, emphasizing a side of the Purge

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:30.580
that the movies have not had a chance to explore.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.139
DeMonaco believes this will make Purge Night
seem even more intense, as people are more

00:08:34.139 --> 00:08:36.769
familiar with the characters and understand
their full arcs.

00:08:36.769 --> 00:08:40.050
Although we don't know who'll star in the
show yet, this seems like an interesting take

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:43.099
on a popular horror series.

00:08:43.099 --> 00:08:44.099
Rise

00:08:44.099 --> 00:08:48.520
Friday Night Lights meets Glee in 2018 courtesy
of NBC's Rise.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:53.519
Based on the 2013 book Drama High, Rise follows
Josh Radnor as Lou, a high school English

00:08:53.519 --> 00:08:57.130
teacher who works in the theater department
in a Rust Belt town in Pennsylvania.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:00.470
He decides to reinvigorate the school's drama
students through their performance of the

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.129
hit musical Spring Awakening.

00:09:02.129 --> 00:09:06.569
The cast also includes Auli'i Cravalho, who
will play a student named Lilette, and Shannon

00:09:06.569 --> 00:09:09.249
Purser, who has a recurring role as a student
named Annabelle.

00:09:09.249 --> 00:09:14.120
Rosie Perez plays the high-energy drama teacher
Tracey, while Rarmian Newton will play a mysterious,

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.999
independent student who works as the school's
lighting technician.

00:09:16.999 --> 00:09:21.430
This Is Us may currently have the monopoly
on NBC's tearjerker slot, but we're on board

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.450
with another good cry every week.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.000
"Let's dream.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.000
Big."

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.000
The Romanoffs

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:31.040
Mad Men creator Matthew Weiner is taking on
Russian royalty with his Amazon anthology

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:34.769
series The Romanoffs, which follows people
who believe they're descended from the famous

00:09:34.769 --> 00:09:35.899
Romanov family.

00:09:35.899 --> 00:09:40.449
The last imperial dynasty to rule Russia,
the Romanovs were eliminated by revolutionaries,

00:09:40.449 --> 00:09:44.170
but some speculate that one daughter, Anastasia,
survived the attack.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:47.959
As many as four of the episodes will be set
in the United States, while four will be set

00:09:47.959 --> 00:09:49.160
and filmed abroad.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:54.540
The show has an all-star cast on board, including
Diane Lane, Aaron Eckhart, Isabelle Huppert,

00:09:54.540 --> 00:10:00.230
Christina Hendricks, John Slattery, Jack Huston,
Amanda Peet, Corey Stoll, and Paul Reiser.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:03.870
Given the impressive work Weiner delivered
on Mad Men and the anthology approach he's

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:08.829
taking with this series, The Romanoffs sounds
like an intriguing new take on an old mystery.

00:10:08.829 --> 00:10:09.860
Thanks for watching!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.149
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:10:12.149 --> 00:10:14.709
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

